      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:4:32:12",
      "text": [
        " أَنَّهُ كَانَ يُسَبِّحُ تَسْبِيحَ فَاطِمَةَ ( صلوات الله عليها ) فَيَصِلُهُ وَ لَا يَقْطَعُهُ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Muhammad Bin Ahmad, from Yaqoub Bin Yazeed, from Muhammad Bin Ja’far, from the one who mentioned it, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> that he<sup>asws</sup> used to Glorify by the Glorification (<span class=\"iTxt\">Tasbīḥ</span>) of Syeda Fatima<sup>asws</sup>, so he<sup>asws</sup> would recite it without interruption’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "12. It is narrated from the narrator of previous Hadith from Muhammad ibn Ahmad from Ya‘qub ibn Yazid from Muhammad ibn Ja‘far from those whom he has mentioned has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, would say Tasbih of Fatimah al-Zahra’, ‘Alayha al-Salam, continuously without interruption.” "
        ]
      }
